  <item nodeId="node-0x5638a95f9ad0">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look feather</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">It&apos;s the beautiful feather of a kingfisher. As you pick it up, you notice a crumpled note wrapped around the shaft.

Taken.

That isn&apos;t available.

